%description:
insideBuilding applies to a UE's radio: a link's building penetration loss is its UE end's, and an
indoor base station is not modelled. The parameter exists on every radio, so **.insideBuilding =
true also marks the base stations; there it changed nothing but two random numbers drawn by the
radio, without a message. On a base station's radio it is an error at initialization.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.gnb.cellularNic.radio.insideBuilding = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
insideBuilding is set on a base station's radio; an indoor base station is not modelled, and the parameter applies to a UE's radio only
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
